# The heaviest load: Arp 16s, slow strum, full room, the bass on Walk, chords changing; then the CPU guard
# (the load forced high: fewer string voices; forced low: they come back)
wait 200
turn K1 12
expect par0 13
tap SEL
turn K1 5
tap FX
turn K3 60
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect playing 1
expect maxvoices 14
cpu 95
wait 1500
expect maxvoices 6
expect voices <7
cpu 30
wait 4000
expect maxvoices >7
cpu 0
wait 9000
expect maxvoices 14
tap PLAY
